    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i just look at them and i feel this massive amount of guilt. like i’m just a constant obstacle in their lives. i hate that they have to sacrifice their own happiness just to keep me going. it feels so selfish of me to even be here when they could be so much freer without all this stress.",
