      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it's just not that simple. it's not just about \"self care.\" it's the fact that my existence is basically a math equation where everyone else is losing. if i wasn't here, my husband could actually travel or focus on his work without worrying if i fell or needed help. the kids could just be kids. it feels like the only way to actually be selfless would be to stop being a problem for them.",
